#: ../../source/example/edit-structure-metadata.md:1
#: 033b21f1acc0422ca725a046c7653148
msgid "批量整理结构元数据"
msgstr "Edit Structure Metadata in Batches"

#: ../../source/example/edit-structure-metadata.md:3
#: e05e0b498c3049499672b26d06e77b00
#
msgid ""
"`Config_type` 和自定义标签常用于记录数据来源、计算阶段或复核状态。需要批量修正时，先选中目标结构，再使用 "
"`编辑信息`，不要为了改几个标签重新拆分和合并文件。"
msgstr "`Config_type` and custom tags commonly record data provenance, calculation stage, or review status. To change them in bulk, select the target structures and use `Edit info`; there is no need to split and merge files just to change a few tags."

#: ../../source/example/edit-structure-metadata.md:5
#: 6890306b88be46c0a0ba0be80935c065
msgid "先限定修改范围"
msgstr "Limit the Edit Scope First"

#: ../../source/example/edit-structure-metadata.md:7
#: ff653b69db554f238deba2b0366acfa7
#
msgid "本例先选中前 3 个结构，然后点击工具栏中的 `编辑信息`："
msgstr "This example selects the first three structures and then clicks `Edit info` on the toolbar:"

